{
  "name": "council-r3-device",
  "issue": 81,
  "title": "Council round 3 (#81): the simulator device window. Reference: Device Hub 27.1 (Xcode 27 has no Simulator app) showing ycode-test-council-iphone. Ycode: its Device Hub showing the same simctl device. Ycode opens the GlassScroll test project first: its Device Hub item needs a workspace window.",
  "targets": [
